{"name":"Kront","status":"ok","title":"Kront","pageId":125898,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"dablink\" style=\"padding-left:2em;\"><i>This article is about the village in the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Dale\" title=\"Great Dale\">Great Dale</a>. For the <a href=\"/wiki/Lizardfolk\" title=\"Lizardfolk\">lizardfolk</a> king, see <span class=\"new\" title=\"Kront (individual) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvS3JvbnRfKGluZGl2aWR1YWwpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Kront (individual)</span>.</i></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Kront</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Hamlet</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 96%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">Half-elf</a>  </td><td> 3%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Elf\" title=\"Elf\">Elf</a>  </td><td> 1%  </td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alignment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alignments</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"alignment-grid\" style=\"caption-side:top;\">  <tbody><tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_good\" title=\"Lawful good\">LG</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_good\" title=\"Neutral good\">NG</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_good\" title=\"Chaotic good\">CG</a></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_neutral\" title=\"Lawful neutral\">LN</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-on\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral\" title=\"Neutral\">N</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_neutral\" title=\"Chaotic neutral\">CN</a></td>  </tr>  <tr>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_evil\" title=\"Lawful evil\">LE</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neutral_evil\" title=\"Neutral evil\">NE</a></td>    <td class=\"alignment-off\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chaotic_evil\" title=\"Chaotic evil\">CE</a></td>  </tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Food and drink</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p102_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p134_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p134-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">267&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374&#160;DR</a><br>400&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Lord Chinilvur (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTG9yZF9DaGluaWx2dXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Lord Chinilvur</span>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374&#160;DR</a><br><span class=\"new\" title=\"Lady Chinilvur (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGFkeV9DaGluaWx2dXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Lady Chinilvur</span>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1479_DR\" title=\"1479 DR\">1479&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Kront (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfS3JvbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Inhabitants of  Kront</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Kront</b> was a small crossroads settlement and trade outpost situated where the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Road\" title=\"Great Road\">Great Road</a> intersected with the <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Road\" title=\"Cold Road\">Cold Road</a> on the plains of <a href=\"/wiki/Ashanath\" title=\"Ashanath\">Ashanath</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East\" title=\"Unapproachable East\">Unapproachable East</a>. It was repudiated by the nearby nations of <a href=\"/wiki/Thesk\" title=\"Thesk\">Thesk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>, and the tribes of <a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a>, and was thus considered a part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Dale\" title=\"Great Dale\">Great Dale</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Defenses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defenses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notable_Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because of the terrible storms that came off <a href=\"/wiki/Lake_Ashane\" title=\"Lake Ashane\">Lake Ashane</a> numerous times a year, all of the structures in Kront were built with cellars in which to to take shelter.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p174_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p174-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Kront was situated on the eastern end of the 300 mi  (480 km) long <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Road\" title=\"Great Road\">Great Road</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p102_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p115_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p115-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> on the western shore of Lake Ashane.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SB.CG-p75_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SB.CG-p75-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>It was located about 20 mi  (32 km) south of the ruins of <a href=\"/wiki/Shandaular\" title=\"Shandaular\">Shandaular</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p131_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p131-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Considering the crossroads town was a neutral locale at a site nestled between several different nations and powers, it made an ideal location for traders to stop along their journeys. Kront's residents traded their wares and provided services for these road-weary merchants.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> They traded goods such as <span class=\"new\" title=\"Hake (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSGFrZT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">hake</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Trout\" title=\"Trout\">trout</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Salmon\" title=\"Salmon\">salmon</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-SB.CG-p75_6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SB.CG-p75-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> from Lake Ashane along with smoked meats.<sup id=\"cite_ref-UE-p125_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-UE-p125-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defenses\">Defenses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defenses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defenses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The independent settlement remained strong even after enduring numerous raids from the <a href=\"/wiki/Nar_(ethnicity)\" title=\"Nar (ethnicity)\">Nars</a> horsemen of nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Narfell\" title=\"Narfell\">Narfell</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRPG-p102_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRPG-p102-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p134_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p134-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Inhabitants\">Notable Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lord <span class=\"new\" title=\"Chinilvur (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2hpbmlsdnVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Chinilvur</span>, the wealthiest man in town that claimed descendance from <a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impilturan</a> nobility.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Durtentan Palander (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHVydGVudGFuX1BhbGFuZGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Durtentan Palander</span>, head of the local <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">ranger</a> group.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Xander Capstal (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvWGFuZGVyX0NhcHN0YWw/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Xander Capstal</span>, captain of the local militia.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Kront?veaction=edit&sect